            "Mod",
            "Alt"
          ],
          "key": "PageUp"
        }
      },
      "note": "Ctrl+Alt+Arrow is screen rotation on Intel drivers (Windows) and workspace switching (GNOME/KDE), so the non-Mac binding moves to PageUp/PageDown — the same pair the tab chords use one level down."
    },
    {
